sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Reader
    participant Web as Web client
    participant API
    participant DB as Database
    participant Store as Object storage

    Reader->>Web: Open document
    Web->>API: Retrieve document (document identifier)
    API->>DB: Query document location
    DB-->>API: Return location
    API->>Store: Request document bytes
    Store-->>API: Return bytes
    API-->>Web: Return document
    Web-->>Reader: Display document
